<title>FINLAND: Outokumpu says Silver Swan mine opens.</title>
<headline>Outokumpu says Silver Swan mine opens.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish mining and metals group Outokumpu Oy said in a statement on Thursday the Silver Swan nickel mine in Australia started operations as planned on June 1.</p>
<p>Outokumpu owns the mine jointly with Mining Project Investors Pty Ltd (MPI).</p>
<p>The company repeated that the probable ore reserve was estimated at 640,000 tonnes with 9.5 percent nickel. &quot;The mine is planned to produce annually some 12,000 tonnes of nickel in concentrates over five years,&quot; Outokumpu said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +3589 6805 0247, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
